From dc1b507f941065831edb6af4930c3f47e1881ea8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Synthetic Benchmark Review <review@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:42:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Add explicit join-search selection and two-seed GOO

Keep native automatic selection as the default and allow callers to
force DP, GEQO, or combined GOO independently of the GEQO threshold.
Run result-size and cost heuristics and reject incomplete searches
instead of falling back to a different algorithm.

Port the GOO search foundation to the current planner and add a
small result/projection regression with disconnected and outer joins.
